{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparkball is a 4v4 adrenaline-packed \u2018sports brawler\u2019 where players select from a cast of lovably unique heroes and carefully balance both ballin' and brawlin' to score in the enemy team's goal! <br><br>Affectionately described as League of Legends meets Rocket League, Sparkball grips you immediately with its dopamine-inducing take on combat sports and keeps you coming back for more as you strive to master its surprisingly complex strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/10d28ffbc0d9c2e1d9aec4805cd356de.avif?t=1761856063\" width=600 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a roster of unique heroes, each with distinct abilities and playstyles.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/eb3b0dc974552805c1268c92c63c112c.avif?t=1761856063\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras_big/eb3b0dc974552805c1268c92c63c112c.avif?t=1761856063 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/a06061f0b1f31db46a178ca44d775179.avif?t=1761856063\" width=600 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle your opponents with strategic precision\u2014or just pure chaos! Knock them off the ball, defend your goal, and dominate the field.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/ec4bfa639fe12fa3e60cac07e464f6da.poster.avif?t=1761856063\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/ec4bfa639fe12fa3e60cac07e464f6da.webm?t=1761856063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/ec4bfa639fe12fa3e60cac07e464f6da.mp4?t=1761856063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/c166766e804663f0671b9b0bdeb433d4.avif?t=1761856063\" width=600 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s not just about fighting\u2014control the ball, coordinate with your team, and score with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/344e03077285ccbe1ccf21e46f0f8a29.poster.avif?t=1761856063\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/344e03077285ccbe1ccf21e46f0f8a29.webm?t=1761856063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/extras/344e03077285ccbe1ccf21e46f0f8a29.mp4?t=1761856063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/672890?t=1761856063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/672890?t=1761856063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/0b49f0560374fdf01586f11921009249b583f8cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761856063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/672890/0b49f0560374fdf01586f11921009249b583f8cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761856063","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1